 of the Coast","work":"Unwelcome","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2016-03-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unwelcome-2016-03-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unwelcome-2016-03-16#:~:text=There%20were%20at%20least,of%20human%20and%20wolf.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unwelcome\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"unwelcome-2016-03-16-e4","summary":"Jace conjures a solid illusory bear that tackles one werewolf.","participants":["jace-beleren","werewolves"],"location":"stensia","importance":"minor","page":"stories/unwelcome-2016-03-16","order":272,"story_date":"2016-03-16","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":30,"quote":"A hulking bear made of shining blue light took form behind him","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unwelcome-2016-03-16#:~:text=A%20hulking%20bear%20made,took%20form%20behind%20him","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Unwelcome","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2016-03-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unwelcome-2016-03-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unwelcome-2016-03-16#:~:text=A%20hulking%20bear%20made,took%20form%20behind%20him","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Unwelcome\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"unwelcome-2016-03-16-e5","summary":"Jace takes control of his guide's mind briefly, making it attack the pack's alpha, so the wolves fight each other.","participants":["jace-beleren","werewolves"],"location":"stensia","importance":"minor","page":"stories/unwelcome-2016-03-16","order":272,"story_date":"2016-03-16","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":34,"quote":"At last, the connection was complete. Jace was in control.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/unwelcome-2016-03-16#:~:text=At%20last